{
  "version": 1,
  "minor_version": 1,
  "key": "lovelace.dashboard_house_status",
  "data": {
    "config": {
      "title": "House Status",
      "views": [
        {
          "title": "Domestic Energy Consumption",
          "path": "domestic-energy-consumption",
          "icon": "mdi:home-lightning-bolt",
          "cards": [
            {
              "type": "grid",
              "columns": 2,
              "square": false,
              "cards": [
                {
                  "type": "tile",
                  "entity": "sensor.lifeos_domestic_import_cost",
                  "name": "Domestic electricity cost",
                  "icon": "mdi:currency-gbp"
                },
                {
                  "type": "tile",
                  "entity": "sensor.lifeos_export_earnings",
                  "name": "Export earnings",
                  "icon": "mdi:cash-plus"
                },
                {
                  "type": "tile",
                  "entity": "sensor.lifeos_net_electricity_cost",
                  "name": "Net electricity cost",
                  "icon": "mdi:scale-balance"
                },
                {
                  "type": "tile",
                  "entity": "sensor.octopus_energy_gas_e6e16309692443_2200667301_current_rate",
                  "name": "Gas price",
                  "icon": "mdi:fire"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "custom:apexcharts-card",
              "header": {
                "show": true,
                "title": "Domestic energy cost & tariff",
                "show_states": false
              },
              "graph_span": "48h",
              "span": {
                "start": "day"
              },
              "now": {
                "show": true,
                "label": "Now"
              },
              "apex_config": {
                "chart": {
                  "height": 360
                },
                "legend": {
                  "show": true
                },
                "stroke": {
                  "curve": "smooth"
                }
              },
              "yaxis": [
                {
                  "id": "price",
                  "decimals": 2,
                  "apex_config": {
                    "title": {
                      "text": "p/kWh"
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "cost",
                  "opposite": true,
                  "decimals": 3,
                  "apex_config": {
                    "title": {
                      "text": "£ / 30 min"
                    }
                  }
                }
              ],
              "series": [
                {
                  "entity": "sensor.lifeos_energy_tariff_horizon",
                  "name": "Electricity price",
                  "type": "line",
                  "unit": "p/kWh",
                  "yaxis_id": "price",
                  "stroke_width": 3,
                  "extend_to": false,
                  "data_generator": "return (entity.attributes.slots || []).filter(x => x.import_p_per_kwh !== null).map(x => [new Date(x.local_from).getTime(), x.import_p_per_kwh]);"
                },
                {
                  "entity": "sensor.lifeos_energy_report",
                  "name": "Electricity used",
                  "type": "line",
                  "unit": "£",
                  "yaxis_id": "cost",
                  "stroke_width": 2,
                  "extend_to": false,
                  "data_generator": "return (entity.attributes.intervals || []).filter(x => x.domestic_import_cost_gbp !== null).map(x => [new Date(x.valid_from).getTime(), x.domestic_import_cost_gbp]);"
                },
                {
                  "entity": "sensor.lifeos_energy_report",
                  "name": "Export earnings",
                  "type": "line",
                  "unit": "£",
                  "yaxis_id": "cost",
                  "stroke_width": 2,
                  "extend_to": false,
                  "data_generator": "return (entity.attributes.intervals || []).filter(x => x.export_earnings_gbp !== null).map(x => [new Date(x.valid_from).getTime(), -x.export_earnings_gbp]);"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "grid",
              "columns": 2,
              "square": false,
              "cards": [
                {
                  "type": "markdown",
                  "content": "### Electricity used\n**£{{ states('sensor.lifeos_domestic_import_cost') }}**\n\n{{ states('sensor.lifeos_domestic_import_energy') }} kWh · {{ states('sensor.lifeos_average_import_price') }} p/kWh weighted average\n\n*Excludes grid energy used to charge the home battery.*"
                },
                {
                  "type": "markdown",
                  "content": "### Energy exported\n**£{{ states('sensor.lifeos_export_earnings') }} earned**\n\n{{ states('sensor.lifeos_export_energy') }} kWh · {{ states('sensor.lifeos_average_export_price') }} p/kWh weighted average"
                },
                {
                  "type": "markdown",
                  "content": "### Gas used\n**Octopus connected**\n\nCurrent rate: {{ states('sensor.octopus_energy_gas_e6e16309692443_2200667301_current_rate') }}\n\nHistorical gas interval ledger is the remaining prerequisite for period-correct gas £ totals."
                },
                {
                  "type": "markdown",
                  "content": "### Net electricity cost\n**£{{ states('sensor.lifeos_net_electricity_cost') }}**\n\nDomestic grid cost − export earnings. Gas is deliberately not added until its matching-period ledger is available."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "entities",
              "title": "Gas meter",
              "show_header_toggle": false,
              "entities": [
                "sensor.octopus_energy_gas_e6e16309692443_2200667301_previous_accumulative_consumption_kwh",
                "sensor.octopus_energy_gas_e6e16309692443_2200667301_previous_accumulative_cost",
                "sensor.octopus_energy_gas_e6e16309692443_2200667301_current_standing_charge"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Full Energy Flow",
          "path": "full-energy-flow",
          "icon": "mdi:transmission-tower",
          "cards": [
            {
              "type": "grid",
              "columns": 4,
              "square": false,
              "cards": [
                {
                  "type": "tile",
                  "entity": "sensor.lifeos_solar_generation_power",
                  "name": "Solar",
                  "icon": "mdi:solar-power"
                },
                {
                  "type": "tile",
                  "entity": "sensor.lifeos_house_demand_power",
                  "name": "House",
                  "icon": "mdi:home-lightning-bolt"
                },
                {
                  "type": "tile",
                  "entity": "sensor.lifeos_energy_battery_soc",
                  "name": "Battery",
                  "icon": "mdi:battery"
                },
                {
                  "type": "markdown",
                  "content": "### EV\n**Not installed**\n\nCharge-only integration slot ready."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "custom:apexcharts-card",
              "header": {
                "show": true,
                "title": "Energy flow & tariff",
                "show_states": true
              },
              "graph_span": "24h",
              "span": {
                "start": "day"
              },
              "now": {
                "show": true,
                "label": "Now"
              },
              "apex_config": {
                "chart": {
                  "height": 390,
                  "stacked": true
                },
                "plotOptions": {
                  "bar": {
                    "columnWidth": "85%"
                  }
                },
                "legend": {
                  "show": true
                }
              },
              "yaxis": [
                {
                  "id": "power",
                  "decimals": 2,
                  "apex_config": {
                    "title": {
                      "text": "kW"
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "price",
                  "opposite": true,
                  "decimals": 2,
                  "apex_config": {
                    "title": {
                      "text": "p/kWh"
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "soc",
                  "opposite": true,
                  "min": 0,
                  "max": 100,
                  "show": false
                }
              ],
              "series": [
                {
                  "entity": "sensor.lifeos_house_demand_power",
                  "name": "House usage",
                  "type": "column",
                  "yaxis_id": "power",
                  "group_by": {
                    "func": "avg",
                    "duration": "30min"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "entity": "sensor.lifeos_battery_charge_power",
                  "name": "Battery charging",
                  "type": "column",
                  "yaxis_id": "power",
                  "group_by": {
                    "func": "avg",
                    "duration": "30min"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "entity": "sensor.lifeos_grid_export_power",
                  "name": "Grid export",
                  "type": "column",
                  "yaxis_id": "power",
                  "transform": "return -Math.abs(x);",
                  "group_by": {
                    "func": "avg",
                    "duration": "30min"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "entity": "sensor.lifeos_energy_import_tariff",
                  "name": "Electricity price",
                  "type": "line",
                  "unit": "p/kWh",
                  "yaxis_id": "price",
                  "stroke_width": 3,
                  "extend_to": false
                },
                {
                  "entity": "sensor.lifeos_energy_battery_soc",
                  "name": "Battery SOC",
                  "type": "line",
                  "unit": "%",
                  "yaxis_id": "soc",
                  "stroke_width": 2
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "grid",
              "columns": 4,
              "square": false,
              "cards": [
                {
                  "type": "tile",
                  "entity": "sensor.lifeos_grid_import_power",
                  "name": "Grid import"
                },
                {
                  "type": "tile",
                  "entity": "sensor.lifeos_grid_export_power",
                  "name": "Grid export"
                },
                {
                  "type": "tile",
                  "entity": "sensor.lifeos_battery_charge_power",
                  "name": "Battery charge"
                },
                {
                  "type": "tile",
                  "entity": "sensor.lifeos_battery_discharge_power",
                  "name": "Battery discharge"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Home Status",
          "path": "home-status",
          "icon": "mdi:home-eye",
          "cards": [
            {
              "type": "grid",
              "columns": 2,
              "square": false,
              "cards": [
                {
                  "type": "markdown",
                  "content": "## Security sensors\n**Not installed**\n\nWindow and external-door overlay positions are reserved. **House secure is intentionally not asserted** until the sensors exist."
                },
                {
                  "type": "markdown",
                  "content": "## Smart lights\n**Planned rollout**\n\nRoom-centre status dots and Leave House membership are ready to be populated as lights are installed."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "picture-elements",
              "image": "/local/house-status/placeholder-floorplan.svg",
              "elements": [
                {
                  "type": "state-icon",
                  "entity": "media_player.westcott_way_living_room_tv",
                  "title": "Living room TV",
                  "tap_action": {
                    "action": "none"
                  },
                  "hold_action": {
                    "action": "none"
                  },
                  "double_tap_action": {
                    "action": "none"
                  },
                  "style": {
                    "left": "31%",
                    "top": "70%"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "type": "state-label",
                  "entity": "media_player.westcott_way_living_room_tv",
                  "prefix": "Living TV: ",
                  "tap_action": {
                    "action": "none"
                  },
                  "style": {
                    "left": "31%",
                    "top": "78%",
                    "font-size": "13px",
                    "background": "rgba(0,0,0,.70)",
                    "padding": "5px 8px",
                    "border-radius": "8px"
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "button",
              "name": "Leave House · automation pending",
              "icon": "mdi:exit-run",
              "entity": "script.house_status_leave_house",
              "show_state": false,
              "tap_action": {
                "action": "none"
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "entities",
              "title": "TV status",
              "show_header_toggle": false,
              "entities": [
                "media_player.westcott_way_living_room_tv",
                "media_player.tv_samsung_5_series_32"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "markdown",
              "content": "**Legend** · Windows/doors: 🟢 open · 🔴 closed · Lights: 🔴 on · 🟢 off · TVs: 🟢 on · 🔴 off · ⚪ unavailable\n\nFuture devices remain **Not installed**, not faulted."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Doorbell",
          "path": "doorbell",
          "icon": "mdi:doorbell-video",
          "cards": [
            {
              "type": "picture-entity",
              "entity": "camera.front_door_live_view",
              "name": "Front Door",
              "camera_view": "live",
              "show_name": true,
              "show_state": true,
              "tap_action": {
                "action": "none"
              },
              "hold_action": {
                "action": "none"
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "grid",
              "columns": 2,
              "square": false,
              "cards": [
                {
                  "type": "tile",
                  "entity": "event.front_door_motion",
                  "name": "Last motion",
                  "icon": "mdi:motion-sensor"
                },
                {
                  "type": "tile",
                  "entity": "event.front_door_ding",
                  "name": "Last doorbell press",
                  "icon": "mdi:doorbell"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "markdown",
              "content": "### Current doorbell · Ring Front Door\nMotion and bell events are enrolled now. **Motion = 30 seconds** and **bell press = 90 seconds** for the presentation window. Repeated motion extends the active window.\n\nAutomatic navigation remains dormant until a supported shared-display control mechanism is proven; bedroom/private displays are not enrolled by default. The entity mapping is isolated so a future replacement doorbell can be swapped without redesigning this view."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  }
}
